{"slug":"ifc","number":"A","title":"IFC4 mapping","file":"spec/core/annex-ifc.md","sections":[],"blocks":[{"t":"p","c":["This annex maps every Floorspec Core kind, the program, extension elements and hosting to the IFC4 (ADD2 TC1) entity that represents it, and names the relationships that connect them. It is normative as a vocabulary: an exporter that writes a Floorspec kind to IFC uses the class and relationships given here. It doubles as the dictionary between the two vocabularies, which is why it lists derived kinds too."]},{"t":"p","c":["Every exported element carries its Floorspec ID in a property set named ",{"t":"code","v":"Floorspec_Identity"}," (property ",{"t":"code","v":"ID"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcIdentifier"},"), so a file exported to IFC, edited in another tool and brought back can be reconciled element by element (FLR-ADR-012)."]},{"t":"table","align":[null,null,null],"head":[["Floorspec"],["IFC4 entity"],["Relationship and notes"]],"rows":[[["Document"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcProject"}],["units in millimetres; the base unit is not an IFC unit, so lengths are converted (÷ 1,280)"]],[["Project"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcProject"}],[{"t":"code","v":"Name"}," = ",{"t":"code","v":"project.name"},"; ",{"t":"code","v":"Description"}," = ",{"t":"code","v":"project.description"}]],[["Site"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcSite"}],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelAggregates"}," (project → site); ",{"t":"code","v":"RefLatitude"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"RefLongitude"}," from ",{"t":"code","v":"location"}," (converted from microdegrees to degrees, minutes, seconds, millionths); ",{"t":"code","v":"trueNorth"}," sets the ",{"t":"code","v":"TrueNorth"}," of the model's geometric context"]],[["Building"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcBuilding"}],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelAggregates"}," (site → building, or project → building when there is no site)"]],[["Level"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcBuildingStorey"}],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelAggregates"}," (building → storey); ",{"t":"code","v":"Elevation"}," = ",{"t":"code","v":"elevation"}]],[["Junction"],["—"],["no entity; the junction graph travels as the ",{"t":"code","v":"Floorspec_Graph"}," property set on each wall (",{"t":"code","v":"StartJunction"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"EndJunction"},", and the junction's position) and as ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelConnectsPathElements"}," between walls that share a junction (",{"t":"code","v":"RelatingConnectionType"}," / ",{"t":"code","v":"RelatedConnectionType"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"ATSTART"}," or ",{"t":"code","v":"ATEND"},")"]],[["Wall"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcWall"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"PredefinedType"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"STANDARD"},")"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelContainedInSpatialStructure"}," (storey → wall); axis representation = location line; body = the derived outline extruded from base to top elevation; ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelDefinesByType"}," → its ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcWallType"},". An arc wall (",{"t":"a","href":"/floorspec/core/conventions#0.4","c":["0.4"]},", ",{"t":"a","href":"/floorspec/core/arcs","c":["chapter 21"]},"): axis = its polyline as an ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcPolyline"},", and its sagitta as ",{"t":"code","v":"Sagitta"},", in millimetres, in its ",{"t":"code","v":"Floorspec_Graph"}," property set; body = its derived outline, face vertices included, extruded"]],[["Wall's layers"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcMaterialLayerSetUsage"}," over an ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcMaterialLayerSet"}],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelAssociatesMaterial"},"; layers in the same order (left face first); ",{"t":"code","v":"DirectionSense"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"NEGATIVE"}," — the wall's axis runs start to end with its left face on +y, so left-to-right is the −y sense; ",{"t":"code","v":"OffsetFromReferenceLine"}," = the distance from the location line to the left face"]],[["Separator"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcVirtualElement"}],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelContainedInSpatialStructure"},"; ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelSpaceBoundary"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"PhysicalOrVirtualBoundary"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"VIRTUAL"},") to the spaces either side"]],[["Opening"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcOpeningElement"}],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelVoidsElement"}," (wall → opening); an opening with a fill adds ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcDoor"}," or ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcWindow"}," and ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelFillsElement"}," (opening → door or window)"]],[["Door type, window type"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcDoorType"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcWindowType"}],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelDefinesByType"}," → the ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcDoor"}," or ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcWindow"}]],[["Door type's ",{"t":"code","v":"operation"}],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcDoorType.OperationType"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"IfcDoorTypeOperationEnum"},")"],["by name, below; ",{"t":"code","v":"NOTDEFINED"}," when no operation is declared"]],[["Window type's ",{"t":"code","v":"operation"}],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcWindowType.PartitioningType"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"IfcWindowTypePartitioningEnum"},") and the ",{"t":"code","v":"OperationType"}," of each ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcWindowPanelProperties"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"IfcWindowPanelOperationEnum"},")"],["by name, below; ",{"t":"code","v":"NOTDEFINED"}," when no operation is declared"]],[["Clear opening"],["—"],["no IFC4 attribute holds a declared net clear opening; it travels as the property set ",{"t":"code","v":"Floorspec_ClearOpening"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"ClearWidth"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"ClearHeight"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"ClearArea"},", converted to millimetres and square metres) on the ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcDoorType"}," or ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcWindowType"},", and on the ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcDoor"}," or ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcWindow"}," of an opening that overrides it"]],[["Room"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcSpace"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"PredefinedType"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"INTERNAL"},", or ",{"t":"code","v":"EXTERNAL"}," for function ",{"t":"code","v":"exterior"},")"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelAggregates"}," (storey → space); ",{"t":"code","v":"Name"}," = ",{"t":"code","v":"name"},"; footprint = the derived room polygon; the room function as ",{"t":"code","v":"Floorspec_Room.Function"},"; ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelSpaceBoundary"}," to bounding walls and separators"]],[["Room finishes"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcCovering"}],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelCoversSpaces"}," (space → covering) for floor and ceiling finishes; ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelCoversBldgElements"}," for a wall finish"]],[["Room's floor (",{"t":"a","href":"/floorspec/core/floors-ceilings-slabs#15.1","c":["15.1"]},")"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcSlab"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"PredefinedType"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"FLOOR"},") when its thickness is declared; otherwise ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcCovering"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"PredefinedType"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"FLOORING"},")"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelContainedInSpatialStructure"}," (storey → slab or covering) and ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelSpaceBoundary"}," to the space; body = the room polygon extruded from its bottom to its top; ",{"t":"code","v":"Name"}," = the room's name; the room's ",{"t":"code","v":"floorFinish"}," as an ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcCovering"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"FLOORING"},") on it by ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelCoversBldgElements"}]],[["Room's ceiling (",{"t":"a","href":"/floorspec/core/floors-ceilings-slabs#15.2","c":["15.2"]},"–",{"t":"a","href":"/floorspec/core/floors-ceilings-slabs#15.5","c":["15.5"]},")"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcCovering"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"PredefinedType"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"CEILING"},")"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelCoversSpaces"}," (space → covering); body = the ceiling surface — flat, its tray's border and raised centre joined by the step, or a vault's planes clipped to the room polygon — as an ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcShellBasedSurfaceModel"},"; the form, ",{"t":"code","v":"height"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"border"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"depth"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"ridge"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"pitch"}," and ",{"t":"code","v":"slopes"}," in the property set ",{"t":"code","v":"Floorspec_Ceiling"},"; the room's ",{"t":"code","v":"ceilingFinish"}," as its material"]],[["Floor offset, ceiling low and high (derived)"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcPropertySingleValue"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"IfcLengthMeasure"},") in the property sets ",{"t":"code","v":"Floorspec_Ceiling"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"Low"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"High"},") and ",{"t":"code","v":"Floorspec_Floor"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"Offset"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"Thickness"},") — IFC4 does not allow quantities in a property set"],["converted to millimetres; ",{"t":"code","v":"Qto_SpaceBaseQuantities.FinishCeilingHeight"}," = the ceiling's low minus the floor's top"]],[["Slab"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcSlab"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"PredefinedType"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"FLOOR"},", or ",{"t":"code","v":"LANDING"}," for the purpose ",{"t":"code","v":"landing"},")"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelContainedInSpatialStructure"},"; body = ",{"t":"code","v":"boundary"}," extruded down by ",{"t":"code","v":"thickness"}," from the level's elevation plus ",{"t":"code","v":"offset"},"; ",{"t":"code","v":"purpose"}," as ",{"t":"code","v":"ObjectType"}," and in the property set ",{"t":"code","v":"Floorspec_Slab"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"Purpose"},")"]],[["Roof (",{"t":"a","href":"/floorspec/core/roofs#16.1","c":["16.1"]},")"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRoof"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"PredefinedType"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"FLAT_ROOF"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"SHED_ROOF"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"GABLE_ROOF"}," or ",{"t":"code","v":"HIP_ROOF"}," for the kinds ",{"t":"code","v":"flat"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"shed"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"gable"}," and ",{"t":"code","v":"hip"},")"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelContainedInSpatialStructure"}," (storey → roof); ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelAggregates"}," (roof → one ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcSlab"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"PredefinedType"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"ROOF"},", for each face), each slab's body the face's polygon, as an ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcShellBasedSurfaceModel"},", or extruded down by the roof's ",{"t":"code","v":"thickness"}," when it declares one; a roof whose surface is not derived (16.4.6) exports its eave outline at its eave as one flat ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcSlab"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"ROOF"},") and ",{"t":"code","v":"PredefinedType"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"NOTDEFINED"},"; ",{"t":"code","v":"pitch"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"overhang"}," and the edges' gables in the property set ",{"t":"code","v":"Floorspec_Roof"},", and the roof's ",{"t":"code","v":"material"}," as each slab's material"]],[["Gable end (derived)"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcWall"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"PredefinedType"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"NOTDEFINED"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"ObjectType"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"\"gable\""},")"],["only when an exporter closes the roof's volume: the gable end's polygon as the wall's surface body; otherwise the gable ends are left to the walls under them"]],[["Wall type"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcWallType"}],["owns the ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcMaterialLayerSet"}]],[["Material"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcMaterial"}],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcMaterialDefinitionRepresentation"}," → ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcStyledRepresentation"}," → ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcStyledItem"}," → ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcSurfaceStyle"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"Side"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"POSITIVE"},"); ",{"t":"code","v":"color"}," as the ",{"t":"code","v":"SurfaceColour"}," of an ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcSurfaceStyleRendering"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"ReflectanceMethod"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"NOTDEFINED"},"; ",{"t":"code","v":"PHYSICAL"}," exists only from IFC4.3), ",{"t":"code","v":"metallic"}," and ",{"t":"code","v":"roughness"}," (",{"t":"a","href":"/floorspec/core/materials#18.1","c":["18.1"]},") in the property set ",{"t":"code","v":"Floorspec_Material"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"Metallic"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"Roughness"},", in thousandths)"]],[["Material's texture (",{"t":"a","href":"/floorspec/core/materials#18.2","c":["18.2"]},")"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcSurfaceStyleWithTextures"}," beside the rendering in the ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcSurfaceStyle"}],["each map an ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcImageTexture"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"URLReference"}," = the asset's ",{"t":"code","v":"path"}," or ",{"t":"code","v":"uri"},"; ",{"t":"code","v":"Mode"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"\"DIFFUSE\""},", ",{"t":"code","v":"\"NORMAL\""},", ",{"t":"code","v":"\"METALLICROUGHNESS\""}," or ",{"t":"code","v":"\"OCCLUSION\""},"); ",{"t":"code","v":"size"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"offset"}," and ",{"t":"code","v":"rotation"}," as its ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcCartesianTransformationOperator2DnonUniform"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"Scale"}," the size in millimetres, the offset and rotation as its origin and axis)"]],[["Asset"],["—"],["carried by the material or extension that uses it; never exported on its own"]],[["A type's or material's ",{"t":"code","v":"source"}," (",{"t":"a","href":"/floorspec/core/types#8.1","c":["8.1"]},")"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcLibraryReference"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"Identification"}," = ",{"t":"code","v":"item"},") whose ",{"t":"code","v":"ReferencedLibrary"}," is an ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcLibraryInformation"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"Name"}," and ",{"t":"code","v":"Location"}," = ",{"t":"code","v":"library"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"Version"}," = ",{"t":"code","v":"version"},")"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelAssociatesLibrary"}," (type → reference); for a material, ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcExternalReferenceRelationship"}," (reference → ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcMaterial"},")"]],[["Wall face finish and region (",{"t":"a","href":"/floorspec/core/materials#18.5","c":["18.5"]},")"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcCovering"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"PredefinedType"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"CLADDING"},"; a region's ",{"t":"code","v":"ObjectType"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"\"region\""},")"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelCoversBldgElements"}," (wall → covering); ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelAssociatesMaterial"}," → the ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcMaterial"},"; body = the region's rectangle on the face, or the whole face; side and extents in the property set ",{"t":"code","v":"Floorspec_Finish"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"Side"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"From"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"To"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"Bottom"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"Top"},", in millimetres)"]],[["Resolved finish (derived, ",{"t":"a","href":"/floorspec/core/materials#18.6","c":["18.6"]},")"],["—"],["not exported: an importer resolves it again from the coverings and the spaces' finishes"]],[["Net area (derived)"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcQuantityArea"}," in ",{"t":"code","v":"Qto_SpaceBaseQuantities.NetFloorArea"}],["converted to square metres"]],[["Program"],["—"],["no entity of its own; its items and adjacencies are exported as below"]],[["Program item"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcSpaceType"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"PredefinedType"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"USERDEFINED"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"ElementType"}," = the item's function)"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelDefinesByType"}," (space type → the ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcSpace"}," of every room whose ",{"t":"code","v":"brief"}," names it); ",{"t":"code","v":"count"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"targetArea"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"minArea"}," (converted to square metres) and ",{"t":"code","v":"level"}," in the property set ",{"t":"code","v":"Floorspec_Program"},". IFC4 has no requirement entity for a brief, so the requirements travel as properties of the type, and the type stands for the item even when no room fulfils it"]],[["Adjacency"],["—"],["no IFC4 entity; exported in the property set ",{"t":"code","v":"Floorspec_Adjacency"}," on the ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcSpaceType"}," of ",{"t":"code","v":"a"},", one ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcPropertyListValue"}," per kind listing the IDs of the ",{"t":"code","v":"b"}," items, and a parallel list of weights"]],[["Room's ",{"t":"code","v":"brief"}],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelDefinesByType"}],["the space's type is its item's ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcSpaceType"}]],[["Extension element (a core-only exporter)"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcBuildingElementProxy"}],["body = the fallback box, or the fallback's glTF asset converted to a tessellated body; ",{"t":"code","v":"ObjectType"}," = ",{"t":"code","v":"<extension>:<collection>"},". An exporter that implements the extension uses the entity the extension's own annex names"]],[["Hosted element, ",{"t":"code","v":"wallFace"}],["the element's entity"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelContainedInSpatialStructure"}," (storey → element) and ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelConnectsElements"}," (wall → element); placement relative to the wall's (",{"t":"code","v":"IfcLocalPlacement"}," with ",{"t":"code","v":"PlacementRelTo"}," the wall's placement)"]],[["Hosted element, ",{"t":"code","v":"surface"}],["the element's entity"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelContainedInSpatialStructure"}," (space → element): the room's ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcSpace"}," contains it"]],[["Hosted element, ",{"t":"code","v":"free"}],["the element's entity"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelContainedInSpatialStructure"}," (storey → element)"]],[["Clearance envelope"],["—"],["not exported. Envelopes are derived from types and hosts, so an importer derives them again; exporting them as ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcVirtualElement"}," would add elements with space-boundary semantics that IFC tools would treat as walls of a space"]],[["Stair (",{"t":"a","href":"/floorspec/core/stairs#17.1","c":["17.1"]},")"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcStair"}," (",{"t":"code","v":"PredefinedType"}," by form, below)"],[{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelContainedInSpatialStructure"}," (the storey of its ",{"t":"code","v":"level"}," → stair); ",{"t":"code","v":"IfcRelAggregates"}," (stair → its flights and landings); ",{"t":"code","v":"width"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"tread"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"risers"}," or ",{"t":"code","v":"maxRiser"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"rotation"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"to"}," and the form's members in the property set ",{"t":"code","v":"Floorspec_Stair"},"; ",{"t":"code","v":"Pset_StairCommon"}," ",{"t":"code","v":"NumberOfRiser"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"NumberOfTreads"},", ",{"t":"code","v":"RiserHeight"}," and ",{"t":"code","v":"TreadLength"}," from the derived values (",{"t":"a","href":"/floorspec/core/stairs#1